","merged_at":"2025-11-06T14:16:40Z"},"body":"Currently, when there are items with icons, `PopupMenu`'s minimum width is one `h_separation` narrower than drawn. This isn't that noticeable, because `h_separation` is relatively small and `PopupMenu` typically has larger paddings introduced by the scrollbar and the background stylebox.\r\n\r\nThis PR also did a bit clean-up as the code for calculating the minimum size has a few unnecessary complexity, probably due to continuous evolution.\r\n\r\nRun this test project and click the Popup button: [test-4.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23362896/test-4.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112377/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112377/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}